---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-slate-900/50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-1 bg-teal-500 rounded-full"></span>
        About Me
      </h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - You can edit this paragraph to sound more personal or formal -->
        <p>
          I am a driven Computer Science student currently pursuing my Bachelor of Science at COMSATS University Islamabad. My academic journey has been fueled by a deep curiosity for how complex systems work and a passion for turning complex problems into elegant software solutions.
        </p>

        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - Adjust how you want to present your AI/ML and full-stack expertise -->
        <p>
          My core technical focus lies at the intersection of Artificial Intelligence and Full-Stack Development. I specialize in building responsive, scalable web applications using the MERN stack and modern frameworks, while seamlessly integrating machine learning models—ranging from computer vision architectures to natural language processing and speech recognition.
        </p>

        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - Adjust your DevOps and engineering philosophy here -->
        <p>
          Beyond writing code, I strongly believe in the importance of robust infrastructure and automated workflows. I have hands-on experience designing CI/CD pipelines, containerizing applications with Docker and Kubernetes, and provisioning cloud resources via AWS and Terraform. I love architecting systems that are not only intelligent but also reliable and highly available.
        </p>

        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - Closing statement and outlook -->
        <p>
          Whether I'm developing an AI-powered articulation therapy assistant or engineering a DevOps pipeline from scratch, I approach every project with a problem-solving mindset and a commitment to continuous learning. I'm always eager to take on new challenges and contribute to impactful technologies.
        </p>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
